 "attestation": "Boundaries from Seshat Cliopatria (Bennett et al., Scientific Data 2025; CC BY 4.0), digitized from standard historical atlases at ~0.07° resolution. Makuria's core territory along the Nile from the Third Cataract to the confluence is well-established archaeologically, but lateral extent into the Bayuda Desert and eastern steppes is poorly documented and boundary reconstructions rely heavily on inference. Capsule researched for this polity/era specifically (confidence: high).",
